18. Object.groupBy()
English Definition

Object.groupBy() groups elements of an iterable into an object according to a value returned by a callback function.

Hindi Definition

Object.groupBy() किसी iterable के elements को callback function से प्राप्त value के आधार पर अलग-अलग groups में रखता है।

Example
const students = [
    { name: "Adyut", course: "BCA" },
    { name: "Rahul", course: "MCA" },
    { name: "Aman", course: "BCA" },
    { name: "Ravi", course: "MCA" }
];

const groups = Object.groupBy(
    students,
    student => student.course
);

console.log(groups);

Conceptual output:

{
    BCA: [
        { name: "Adyut", course: "BCA" },
        { name: "Aman", course: "BCA" }
    ],

    MCA: [
        { name: "Rahul", course: "MCA" },
        { name: "Ravi", course: "MCA" }
    ]
}
Hindi में
Students
   ↓
course के आधार पर grouping
   ↓
 ┌────────────┐
 │ BCA Group  │
 └────────────┘

 ┌────────────┐
 │ MCA Group  │
 └────────────┘

Note: Object.groupBy() modern JavaScript feature है। बहुत पुराने browsers/environments में इसका support उपलब्ध न हो सकता है।

Step 4 – Getters and Setters
19. Object Accessors
English Definition

Getters and setters are special methods used to control how an object property is read and modified.

Hindi Definition

Getters और Setters special methods होते हैं जिनका उपयोग object की property को read और modify करने के तरीके को control करने के लिए किया जाता है।

20. Getter – get
English Definition

A getter is a special method that is used to get or read a property value.

Hindi Definition

Getter एक special method है जिसका उपयोग property की value को read/get करने के लिए किया जाता है।

Syntax
get propertyName() {
    return value;
}
Example
const student = {

    firstName: "Adyut",
    lastName: "Khan",

    get fullName() {
        return this.firstName + " " + this.lastName;
    }

};

console.log(student.fullName);

Output:

Adyut Khan
Important

Getter को function की तरह:

student.fullName()

नहीं लिखते।

Getter को property की तरह:

student.fullName

access करते हैं।

21. Setter – set
English Definition

A setter is a special method used to set or modify a property value.

Hindi Definition

Setter एक special method है जिसका उपयोग object की property की value को set या modify करने के लिए किया जाता है।

Example
const student = {

    name: "",

    set studentName(value) {
        this.name = value;
    }

};

student.studentName = "Adyut";

console.log(student.name);

Output:

Adyut
22. Getter and Setter Together
const student = {

    firstName: "Adyut",
    lastName: "Khan",

    get fullName() {
        return this.firstName + " " + this.lastName;
    },

    set fullName(value) {

        const parts = value.split(" ");

        this.firstName = parts[0];
        this.lastName = parts[1];

    }

};

console.log(student.fullName);

student.fullName = "Rahul Sharma";

console.log(student.fullName);

Output:

Adyut Khan
Rahul Sharma
