24. Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor()
English Definition

Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor() returns the descriptor of a specified own property.

Hindi Definition

Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor() किसी object की specified own property का descriptor return करता है।

Syntax
Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(object, property);
Example
const student = {
    name: "Adyut"
};

console.log(
    Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(student, "name")
);

Output में लगभग:

{
    value: "Adyut",
    writable: true,
    enumerable: true,
    configurable: true
}
25. Object.defineProperty()
English Definition

Object.defineProperty() adds a new property or changes the attributes of an existing property.

Hindi Definition

Object.defineProperty() किसी object में नई property add कर सकता है या existing property के attributes को change कर सकता है।

Syntax
Object.defineProperty(object, property, descriptor);
Practical Example
const student = {};

Object.defineProperty(student, "name", {

    value: "Adyut",
    writable: false

});

console.log(student.name);

student.name = "Rahul";

console.log(student.name);

Output:

Adyut
Adyut
Why?

writable: false के कारण property की value change नहीं होगी।

